    "difficulty": "Challenging",
    "isSketch": false,
    "statement": "A projectile is fired at angle $\\pi/4$ with speed $v$. Later, a second projectile is fired from the same point at speed $2v$. What is the latest time $\\Delta t$ at which the second projectile can be fired so that the two projectiles intersect on the ground?",
